:61,"end":65,"surface":"新都都尉","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080-pei01-01:m0065","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"t-wu059-deng-5","person_id":"djn_r5z_2w9","kind":"office","title":"翼正都尉","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本句所載職官，任免時間未詳。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-059","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-deng","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-deng","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-deng:line012","quote":"孫登字子高，權長子也。魏黃初二年，以權爲吳王，拜登東中郎將，封萬戶侯，登辭疾不受。是歲，立登爲太子，選置師傅，銓簡秀士，以爲賔友，於是諸葛恪、張休、顧譚、陳表等以選入，侍講詩書，出從騎射。權欲登讀《漢書》，習知近代之事，以張昭有師法，重煩勞之，乃令休從昭受讀，還以授登。登待接寮屬，略用布衣之禮，與恪、休、譚等或同輿而載，或共帳而寐。太傅張溫言於權曰：「夫中庶子官最親密，切問近對，宜用儁德。」於是乃用表等爲中庶子。後又以庶子禮拘，復令整巾侍坐。黃龍元年，權稱尊號，登爲皇太子，以恪爲左輔，休右弼，譚爲輔正，表爲翼正都尉，是爲四友，而謝景、范慎、刁玄、羊衜等皆爲賔客，於是東宮號爲多士。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-deng:line012:m0077"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu059-deng-5:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-deng:line012","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-deng:line012:m0077","start":256,"end":260,"surface":"翼正都尉","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete:line080-pei01-01","text":"吴书曰：融字叔长，生於宠贵，少而骄乐，学为章句，博而不精，性宽容，多技艺，数以巾褐奉朝请，后拜骑都尉。赤乌中，诸郡出部伍，新都都尉陈表、吴郡都尉顾承各率所领人会佃毗陵，男女各数万口。表病死，权以融代表，后代父瑾领摄。","text_layer":"witness_appende